/Animation/goHero/airImpaleLand/
  clipId          10            ; [real] ANM_hero.bin act id
  duration        1.2333s       ; [real] 37 frames @30
  blendIn         0s        ; [real] act header +0x04 (hard cut)
  keyframeRate    15Hz         ; [real] sample interval
  anmHeader       0xD580       ; [real] offset in ANM_hero.bin

/Combat/goHero/airImpaleLand/Windows/          ; [inferred] adjustable model —
