  branchPoint     0.86s        ; queued branch executes
  cancelOpens     0.62s        ; L1 block-cancel window

/Combat/goHero/airImpaleLand/Branches/
  (none — recovers to stance)
  cancel  input=L1             -> block            window=[0.62..1.23]s  [inferred]  ; block-cancel recovery
